⚡️🇺🇸🇮🇷 At least 624 US troops have been wounded since President Trump ordered strikes on Iran in February, according to the Pentagon.

Newly obtained records show over 400 casualties, 17 life-threatening injuries, and 6 troops killed in an Iranian drone strike on 1 March.

