⚡️🇺🇸 Hundreds of Anthropic Claude conversations were briefly discoverable through Google Search after users shared public chat links, exposing sensitive information including résumés, corporate project details, healthcare discussions, and even cryptocurrency wallet keys.

Anthropic says chats only become public when users choose to generate a share link, but the company has since removed the links from search indexing after users discovered more than 200 conversations were searchable. Existing shared links may still remain accessible to anyone who already has them.

